        {
          "id": "a0b1c2d",
          "elType": "widget",
          "widgetType": "text-editor",
          "settings": {
            "editor": "<p style=\"font-family: 'Lora', serif; font-size: 1.1rem; line-height: 1.85; color: #4A5568; text-align: center;\">Plastic-Craft provides custom-fabricated plastic solutions for retail environments where presentation, durability, and brand impact are essential. From point-of-purchase displays to store fixtures and protective barriers, our plastics deliver the clarity, strength, and design flexibility that modern retail demands.</p><p style=\"font-family: 'Lora', serif; font-size: 1.1rem; line-height: 1.85; color: #4A5568; text-align: center;\">Our in-house fabrication capabilities &mdash; including CNC machining, thermoforming, bending, polishing, and assembly &mdash; allow us to produce retail-ready components with fast turnaround and consistent quality. Whether you need a one-off prototype or a full production run, Plastic-Craft is your single-source partner for retail plastic solutions.</p>",
            "align": "center"
          },
          "elements": []
        }
      ],
      "isInner": false
    },
    {
      "id": "e3f4a5b",
      "elType": "container",
      "settings": {
        "content_width": "full",
        "padding": {
